Correction: avoid expressing the interaction as an implicit container-to-nested-id shortcut if the nested element is not independently declared in the view scope. Use declared aliases and explicit component interactions.

```likec4
model {
  system api_container 'API Container'
  component auth_component 'Auth Component'

  api_container -> auth_component 'Delegates auth check'
}

views {
  dynamic authentication_sequence {
    title 'Authentication Sequence'

    api_container -> auth_component 'Verify credentials/token'
    auth_component -> api_container 'Result: allow/deny'
  }
}
```
